OL,3,ATrump welcomes Xi at airport with red
OL,4,Acarpet and military flyover to kick off
OL,5,Athree-day US visit
OL,6,
OL,7,FDonald Trump has welcomed Xi Jinping at
OL,8,Fthe airport with a red carpet and
OL,9,Fmilitary flyover to kick off a historic
OL,10,Fthree-day US visit
OL,12,FAfter shaking hands during a brief -
OL,13,Fbut ornate - greeting, Trump and Xi
OL,14,Fdeparted Joint Base Andrews en route
OL,15,Ffor Washington DC
OL,17,FThe US president was seen walking Xi to
OL,18,Fhis car and the two exchanged
OL,19,Fconversation briefly - the Chinese
OL,20,Fleader appeared to nod alongside one of
OL,21,Fhis delegates
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
